---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Feedback & Contact | IT365.kr"
  description="Send article feedback, suggest AI & tech topics for coverage, or reach out for business and partnership inquiries at IT365.kr."
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl="https://it365.kr/en/contact/"
  koAlternateUrl="https://it365.kr/ko/contact/"
  enAlternateUrl="https://it365.kr/en/contact/"
  koSwitchUrl="/ko/contact/"
  enSwitchUrl="/en/contact/"
>
  <article class="article-container">
    <h1>✉️ Feedback & Inquiries</h1>
    <p>
      Thank you for reading <strong>IT365.kr</strong>. Whether you have feedback on an article, a suggestion for an AI model or hardware comparison, or a partnership inquiry, we would love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <h2>📌 How Can We Help?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>💬 Article Feedback & Corrections:</strong> Questions, benchmark updates, or editorial feedback</li>
      <li><strong>💡 Topic Suggestions:</strong> AI models, developer tools, or upcoming hardware you would like us to compare</li>
      <li><strong>🤝 Business & Partnerships:</strong> Sponsorships, review units, and media collaborations</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="takeaways-box" style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">
      <div class="takeaways-title">
        <span>📮</span>
        <strong>Direct Contact</strong>
      </div>
      <ul class="takeaways-list">
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:minung2073@gmail.com">minung2073@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Response Time:</strong> Typically within 24–48 business hours.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
